"},{"text":"SolidWorks"},{"text":"Fusion 360"},{"text":"Blender"},{"text":"Autodesk Alias"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Rendering"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"KeyShot"},{"text":"V-Ray"},{"text":"Blender rendering"},{"text":"Enscape"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technical"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AutoCAD"},{"text":"CAD drawing standards"},{"text":"Basic manufacturing documentation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The objective is not to collect software certificates."},{"type":"p","text":"The objective is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Sketch","CAD","Prototype","Test","Refine","Manufacture"]}]},{"heading":"Portfolio Projects","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong Product Design portfolio should show the complete product-development process."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Ceramic Tableware"},{"type":"p","text":"Show:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"User research"},{"text":"Ergonomics"},{"text":"Sketches"},{"text":"Form development"},{"text":"Clay experiments"},{"text":"Prototype"},{"text":"Final product"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Glass Lighting Product"},{"type":"p","text":"Demonstrate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Lighting requirements"},{"text":"Glass form"},{"text":"Material experiments"},{"text":"Structure"},{"text":"CAD"},{"text":"Prototype"},{"text":"Rendering"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Sustainable Product"},{"type":"p","text":"Design a product using:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Recycled materials"},{"text":"Renewable materials"},{"text":"Modular components"},{"text":"Repairable construction"},{"text":"Minimal material usage"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Consumer Product"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a product that solves a real everyday problem."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Product Family"},{"type":"p","text":"Design a coordinated collection:"},{"type":"p","text":"Product A"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Product B"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Product C"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"flow","items":["Product D","Unified Product System"]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 6 — Final-Year Project"},{"type":"p","text":"A production-oriented product system with complete documentation."}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Product design studios"},{"text":"Industrial design consultancies"},{"text":"Ceramic manufacturers"},{"text":"Glass manufacturers"},{"text":"Homeware brands"},{"text":"Furniture companies"},{"text":"Lighting companies"},{"text":"Lifestyle brands"},{"text":"Consumer-product companies"},{"text":"Luxury brands"},{"text":"Hospitality product manufacturers"},{"text":"Sustainable product companies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Suitable Internship Roles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Product Design Intern"},{"text":"Industrial Design Intern"},{"text":"Ceramic Design Intern"},{"text":"Glass Design Intern"},{"text":"Furniture Design Intern"},{"text":"Homeware Design Intern"},{"text":"3D Design Intern"},{"text":"Product Development Intern"},{"text":"Design Research Intern"}]}]},{"heading":"Strong Internship Project","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A valuable internship project could be:"},{"type":"h","text":"\"Redesign an Existing Household Product\""},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"h","text":"Ceramic food-storage container"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Existing product"},{"text":"User complaints"},{"text":"Manufacturing process"},{"text":"Material usage"},{"text":"Ergonomics"},{"text":"Storage efficiency"},{"text":"Cleaning"},{"text":"Packaging"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Then develop:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Existing Product","User Research","Problems","Design Brief","Concepts","CAD","Prototype","Testing","Refinement","Production Proposal"]},{"type":"p","text":"This demonstrates real product-design thinking."}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[